  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ORDER, SQL-UNION-03: Without ORDER BY, in what order do the rows come out of UNION and UNION ALL of UA (v 20 down to 1), UB (v 11 to 30) and UC (v = n * 7 Mod 23), in both arm orders, with three arms, with mixed UNION and UNION ALL, with a literal arm tag column, and over k of OT5 and OT3 (one GetRows(300) per statement)? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-order opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
